<title>USA: US corn gluten prices flat in fairly quiet trade.</title>
<headline>US corn gluten prices flat in fairly quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten pellet prices were unchanged Friday in fairly quiet dealings. The resumption of cold weather has sparked some interest from livestock feeders, dealers said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
